    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d692">

                <pb facs="1269" n="1247" sameAs="frus:frus1950v05/pg1247"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.53/1–2050: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Embassy in Turkey </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1950-03-31T17:00:00-05:00">March 31, 1950—5
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>140. Treas Dept reports disturbing increase heroin addiction US cities.
                    Istanbul’s desp 38, Jan 20,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d692-f1"/> appears confirm
                    Treas opinion major part this heroin originates Istanbul.</p>
                <p> Emb requested inform appropriate Turk auths US Govt concerned notwithstanding
                    excellent work Istanbul police and suggest desirability continued close
                    cooperation Istanbul police and US Bureau Narcotics. Latter ready send competent
                    agent visit Istanbul collaborate <pb facs="1270" n="1248" xml:id="pg1248"/>
                    police in order furnish names and addresses suspected traffickers and for other
                    activities. Inquire discreetly whether Turk Govt wld be disposed extend
                    invitation this purpose.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
